{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37963","headline":"题净衆寺古松 · 崔涂","name":"题净衆寺古松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺森疎倚梵台，昔人谁见此初栽。\n故园未有偏堪恋，浮世如闲即合来。\n天暝岂分苍翠色，岁寒应识栋梁材。\n清阴可惜不驻得，归去暮城空首回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}